 "name_en": "Joint Venture Accounting (3F7)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Joint Venture Accounting (3F7)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio48bf170fbe964329809c1d6eb1bc8a9d\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio48bf170fbe964329809c1d6eb1bc8a9d__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">With this scope item, you can execute the main joint venture accounting functionalities, such as setting up master data, actual posting, month-end processes, and reports.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio48bf170fbe964329809c1d6eb1bc8a9d__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Master Data – Maintain joint venture, joint venture partner, joint operating agreement</li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Actual posting – Operated and non-operated net/gross cash call</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Month-end processes – Schedule job for cutback, cash call update/reclassification, equity change/adjustment, netting, overhead, billing, funding</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reporting – Venture expenses, partner net by cost object, gross non-operated by cost object, remaining cutback, partner billing report</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage output items for cash call and billing</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio48bf170fbe964329809c1d6eb1bc8a9d__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute actual postings and month-end processes</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>合资企业会计 (3F7)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio48bf170fbe964329809c1d6eb1bc8a9d\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio48bf170fbe964329809c1d6eb1bc8a9d__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过此范围项目，您可以执行主要的合资企业会计功能，例如设置主数据、实际过账、月末流程和报表。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio48bf170fbe964329809c1d6eb1bc8a9d__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">主数据 - 维护合资企业、合资企业合作伙伴、联合经营协议</li>\n      </ul>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">实际过账 - 运营和非经营性净/总现金通知</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">月末流程 – 计划缩减作业、筹现金通知更新/重新分类、权益变更/调整、净值结算、间接费用、开票、融资</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">报告 - 企业费用、按成本对象划分的合作伙伴净额、按成本对象划分的非经营性总额、剩余缩减、合作伙伴开票报告</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理筹现金通知与开票的输出项目</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio48bf170fbe964329809c1d6eb1bc8a9d__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">执行实际过账和月末流程</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
